# Excellent Tiling Services (ETS)

> Perth tiling and bathroom renovation company with its own tile and bathroomware store. Excellent Tiling Services Pty Ltd has been tiling in Perth since 2011 from its base in Maddington, Western Australia. It supplies and installs porcelain tiles, vanities, tapware, baths, toilets, mirrors and tiling tools: online, through a by-appointment showroom, and through its own licensed and insured renovation team.

Also known as: ETS, Excellent Tiling Service, Excellent Tiling Services Pty Ltd (ABN 63 150 082 054).

## Key facts

- Showroom: 17A Olga Road, Maddington WA 6109, Australia. By appointment only, Monday to Saturday 4:30 pm to 9 pm, closed Sunday.
- Phone: 0450 960 543 (+61 450 960 543)
- Email: contactus@excellenttilingservices.com
- Renovation and tiling service area: the Perth metropolitan area, Western Australia.
- Online store: small items ship Australia-wide and to selected international countries. Tiles and large items are Perth metro delivery, free pickup from Maddington, or a freight quote.
- Customers: homeowners, renovators, builders, tilers and plumbers. Trade accounts are available.

## What we do

- Bathroom, ensuite and powder room renovations: strip-out, waterproofing, screeding, floor and wall tiling, and fit-off of vanity, toilet, tapware and shower screen.
- Kitchen splashbacks, feature walls and laundry tiling.
- Floor and wall tiling for any room, including large-format porcelain, alfresco and outdoor areas, and herringbone or brick-bond layouts.
- Waterproofing and leaking shower repairs: re-grouting, re-sealing, regrading, new membranes and tile replacement, without a full renovation where possible.
- Supply and install: customers choose products in the Maddington showroom and one quote covers supply and labour.
- Every job starts with a free measure and written quote.

## What we sell

- [Tiles]({{ base }}/collections/tiles): porcelain, ceramic and mosaic tiles priced per m², in sizes including 300 x 300, 300 x 600, 600 x 600 and 600 x 1200 mm, with matt, lappato, gloss and anti-slip finishes. ETS ranges include Morgan, Time Stone, Cement, Lava, Particle and Terrazzo.
- [Vanities & basins]({{ base }}/collections/vanities-basins): wall-hung, single and double vanities, tallboys, and above-counter, inset, semi-recessed and undermount basins.
- [Tapware & sinks]({{ base }}/collections/tapware-sinks): basin, wall and kitchen mixers, shower sets, spouts, and kitchen and laundry sinks.
- [Baths & toilets]({{ base }}/collections/baths-toilets): freestanding, back-to-wall, corner and inset baths, rimless and wall-faced toilet suites, and shower screens.
- [Mirrors & accessories]({{ base }}/collections/mirrors-accessories): LED mirrors, mirror cabinets, towel rails and bathroom accessories.
- [Tiling tools & hardware]({{ base }}/collections/hardware): trowels, tile cutters, diamond blades, silicone, grout, tile trims, floor wastes, mixers and spare parts from brands including Raimondi, Sigma, BAT, Maxisil, Roberts Designs, Baron and Washboy.

